# Demo package: the README and launcher are code, the media is regenerable.
# Clips come from scripts/export_demo_clip.py, pre-rendered ones from
# scripts/demo.py --output. Checkpoints are copied in per demo_package/README.md.
# Root-anchored, per the invariant in ARCHITECTURE.md.
/demo_package/clips/
/demo_package/prerendered/
# The unanchored `checkpoints/` above matches at any depth, and git will not
# descend into an excluded DIRECTORY -- so the directory must be un-ignored
# before a file inside it can be. Same root-anchoring trap as invariant 11.
!/demo_package/checkpoints/
/demo_package/checkpoints/*
!/demo_package/checkpoints/.gitkeep

# Handover snapshots: regenerable evidence artifacts, HANDOVER.md is the doc.
/handover/snapshots/

# Reference papers are not committed (publisher copyright); keep them outside the repo.
/*.pdf
